sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Uploader
    participant D as Dashboard
    participant A as Lambda API
    participant S as S3
    participant Q as SQS
    participant P as Lambda Pipeline
    participant G as Gemini
    participant DB as DynamoDB

    U->>D: pilih video, isi judul, pilih peran
    D->>A: POST /uploads (judul, peran)
    A->>A: validasi token, buat video_id
    A-->>D: presigned PUT URL + metadata
    D->>S: PUT video langsung ke S3
    S-->>D: 200 OK
    S->>Q: event ObjectCreated
    Q->>P: kirim pesan (batch 1)
    P->>S: unduh video, baca metadata
    P->>DB: ambil / buat template
    P->>G: transkrip audio dan nilai frame
    G-->>P: verdict, bukti, timestamp
    P->>DB: simpan hasil AI (results)
    P-->>Q: sukses, pesan dihapus
    D->>A: GET /videos (polling)
    A->>DB: baca status
    A-->>D: video siap direview
